<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- Chi -->
  <!--原中文: '"气"', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Ch'i',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Ch'i-->
  <TM_Chi.label>&amp;quot;气&amp;quot;</TM_Chi.label>
  <!--原中文: '“气”或者说魂力，是存在于所有生命中的特殊能量，武僧们通过修炼来使用这种力量击退敌人施展法术，平衡“气”的节奏和流动需要大量的时间，通常武僧们会选择通过冥想来平衡。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Ch'i, or spirit, is the life force that resides in all living things. Monks cultivate and harness this force to perform their art. Balancing the rhythm and flow of Ch'i takes time and is generally gained through dedicated meditation.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Ch'i, or spirit, is the life force that resides in all living things. Monks cultivate and harness this force to perform their art. Balancing the rhythm and flow of Ch'i takes time and is generally gained through dedicated meditation.-->
  <TM_Chi.description>“气”或者说魂力，是存在于所有生命中的特殊能量，武僧们通过修炼来使用这种力量击退敌人施展法术，平衡“气”的节奏和流动需要大量的时间，通常武僧们会选择通过冥想来平衡。</TM_Chi.description>
  <!-- Chi Burst -->
  <!--原中文: '气功波', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Ch'i Burst',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Ch'i Burst-->
  <TM_ChiBurst.label>气功波</TM_ChiBurst.label>
  <!--原中文: '将大量的气投射到目标区域，使目标区域内所有小人的能量过载。投射出去的“气”将中断战士和法师的能力，并将对他们的能力池造成伤害，如灵能、法力、血魔法、体力、恶意、“气”等。\n  有较低的几率移除小人的精神状态，可以被抵抗。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Projects an enormous amount of ch'i into a target area, overloading and disrupting the energy of all pawns within the area of effect.

Ch'i Burst will interrupt fighter and mage abilities and will cause harm based on the amount of energy disrupted. This affects chi, mana, blood magic, stamina, hate and psionic energy.

Has a low chance to disrupt the mental state of any pawn. Can be resisted.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Projects an enormous amount of ch'i into a target area, overloading and disrupting the energy of all pawns within the area of effect.

Ch'i Burst will interrupt fighter and mage abilities and will cause harm based on the amount of energy disrupted. This affects chi, mana, blood magic, stamina, hate and psionic energy.

Has a low chance to disrupt the mental state of any pawn. Can be resisted.-->
  <TM_ChiBurst.description>将大量的气投射到目标区域，使目标区域内所有小人的能量过载。投射出去的“气”将中断战士和法师的能力，并将对他们的能力池造成伤害，如灵能、法力、血魔法、体力、恶意、“气”等。\n  有较低的几率移除小人的精神状态，可以被抵抗。</TM_ChiBurst.description>
  <!-- Mind Over Body -->
  <!--原中文: '御气护体', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Mind Over Body',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Mind Over Body-->
  <TM_MindOverBody.label>御气护体</TM_MindOverBody.label>
  <!--原中文: '提高武僧对身体的控制，提高他们对压力的适应能力，提供伤害减免（随盔甲的重量减少）\n  被动增益意识、移动、操作、近战命中几率、闪避、护甲穿透、崩溃临界点和疼痛阈值。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Mental conditioning that enhances the monk's control over their physical capabilities and improves resilience to both physical and mental stress. Damage mitigation is reduced by the weight (in kg) of armor worn.

Mind Over Body is a passive buff that improves consciousness, moving, manipulation, melee hit chance, dodge chance, armor penetration, mental break and pain thresholds.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Mental conditioning that enhances the monk's control over their physical capabilities and improves resilience to both physical and mental stress. Damage mitigation is reduced by the weight (in kg) of armor worn.

Mind Over Body is a passive buff that improves consciousness, moving, manipulation, melee hit chance, dodge chance, armor penetration, mental break and pain thresholds.-->
  <TM_MindOverBody.description>提高武僧对身体的控制，提高他们对压力的适应能力，提供伤害减免（随盔甲的重量减少）\n  被动增益意识、移动、操作、近战命中几率、闪避、护甲穿透、崩溃临界点和疼痛阈值。</TM_MindOverBody.description>
  <!-- Meditate -->
  <!--原中文: '冥想', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Meditate',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Meditate-->
  <TM_Meditate.label>冥想</TM_Meditate.label>
  <!--原中文: '冥想可以恢复武僧的生命力，是保持“气”的重要方式\n  在冥想产生“气”之前，必须保证武僧的身体与精神状况良好，如果武僧收到折磨（伤口、疾病、精神崩溃、毒瘾等），冥想将只会消除痛苦，痛苦只能在冥想状态下被移除。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Meditation restores the life force of the monk and is a vital component of maintaining a strong level of Ch'i.
	
Any physical or mental ailments must be purged before meditation can generate Ch'i. If the monk is afflicted (wounds, disease, poor mood, drug addictions), meditation will focus Ch'i in an effort to remove the affliction. Afflictions can only be purged while in a meditative state.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Meditation restores the life force of the monk and is a vital component of maintaining a strong level of Ch'i.
	
Any physical or mental ailments must be purged before meditation can generate Ch'i. If the monk is afflicted (wounds, disease, poor mood, drug addictions), meditation will focus Ch'i in an effort to remove the affliction. Afflictions can only be purged while in a meditative state.-->
  <TM_Meditate.description>冥想可以恢复武僧的生命力，是保持“气”的重要方式\n  在冥想产生“气”之前，必须保证武僧的身体与精神状况良好，如果武僧收到折磨（伤口、疾病、精神崩溃、毒瘾等），冥想将只会消除痛苦，痛苦只能在冥想状态下被移除。</TM_Meditate.description>
  <!-- Tiger Strike -->
  <!--原中文: '一种近战攻击，对一个对手进行多次快速打击。必须在近战范围内且没有武器才能执行此攻击。\n\n\n\n激活能力（12“气”）：快速连续发动4次攻击。猛虎下山可以进一步训练，以增加额外的攻击，可以晕眩，消耗能量，或提供破坏重要器官的精确攻击。\n\n\n\n被动能力（8耐力）：对一个对手进行多次攻击；攻击可以是任何类型（物理攻击、眩晕攻击、消耗攻击、致命攻击）。猛虎下山有机会触发连击。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'A melee attack that delivers multiple, rapid blows against a single opponent. Must be within melee range and unarmed to perform this attack.

Activated ability (12 chi): delivers 4 attacks in rapid succession.  Tiger Strike can be further trained to add additional attacks that can stun, drain energy, or deliver a precision strike that destroys vital organs.

Passive ability (8 stamina): deliver multiple hits against an opponent; attacks may be any type (physical, stun, drain, vital) that is trained. Tiger Strike has a chance to trigger on any normal attack or itself.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: A melee attack that delivers multiple, rapid blows against a single opponent. Must be within melee range and unarmed to perform this attack.

Activated ability (12 chi): delivers 4 attacks in rapid succession.  Tiger Strike can be further trained to add additional attacks that can stun, drain energy, or deliver a precision strike that destroys vital organs.

Passive ability (8 stamina): deliver multiple hits against an opponent; attacks may be any type (physical, stun, drain, vital) that is trained. Tiger Strike has a chance to trigger on any normal attack or itself.-->
  <TM_TigerStrike.description>一种近战攻击，对一个对手进行多次快速打击。必须在近战范围内且没有武器才能执行此攻击。\n\n\n\n激活能力（12“气”）：快速连续发动4次攻击。猛虎下山可以进一步训练，以增加额外的攻击，可以晕眩，消耗能量，或提供破坏重要器官的精确攻击。\n\n\n\n被动能力（8耐力）：对一个对手进行多次攻击；攻击可以是任何类型（物理攻击、眩晕攻击、消耗攻击、致命攻击）。猛虎下山有机会触发连击。</TM_TigerStrike.description>
  <!-- Dragon Strike -->
  <!--原中文: '一种跳跃攻击，使僧侣能迅速接近对手。\n\n\n\n激活能力(8“气”):跃过空中，向远处的对手发出有力的飞踢。敌人越接近，潜龙出渊造成的伤害就越多。如果对手在5格内，此攻击也会将目标击退。\n\n\n\n被动能力(10耐力):执行一个能攻击多个对手的回旋踢。当多个敌人靠近目标时，潜龙出渊有机会触发。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'A leap attack that allows the monk to rapidly close on an opponent. 

Activated ability (8 chi): leap through the air and deliver a powerful flying kick against an distant opponent. The closer an opponent is, the more damage Dragon Strike deals. If an opponent is within 5 cells, this attack will also knock the target back. 

Passive ability (10 stamina): performs a round-house kick that strikes multiple opponents. Dragon Strike has a chance to trigger on any normal attack when multiple enemies are near the target.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: A leap attack that allows the monk to rapidly close on an opponent. 

Activated ability (8 chi): leap through the air and deliver a powerful flying kick against an distant opponent. The closer an opponent is, the more damage Dragon Strike deals. If an opponent is within 5 cells, this attack will also knock the target back. 

Passive ability (10 stamina): performs a round-house kick that strikes multiple opponents. Dragon Strike has a chance to trigger on any normal attack when multiple enemies are near the target.-->
  <TM_DragonStrike.description>一种跳跃攻击，使僧侣能迅速接近对手。\n\n\n\n激活能力(8“气”):跃过空中，向远处的对手发出有力的飞踢。敌人越接近，潜龙出渊造成的伤害就越多。如果对手在5格内，此攻击也会将目标击退。\n\n\n\n被动能力(10耐力):执行一个能攻击多个对手的回旋踢。当多个敌人靠近目标时，潜龙出渊有机会触发。</TM_DragonStrike.description>
  <!-- Thunder Strike -->
  <!--原中文: '奔雷掌', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Thunder Strike',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Thunder Strike-->
  <TM_ThunderStrike.label>奔雷掌</TM_ThunderStrike.label>
  <!--原中文: '用足够的气来发动攻击以产生闪电。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Supercharges an attack with enough ch'i to generate lightning.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Supercharges an attack with enough ch'i to generate lightning.-->
  <TM_ThunderStrike.description>用足够的气来发动攻击以产生闪电。</TM_ThunderStrike.description>
</LanguageData>
